<title>USA: USAir December load factor rises to 68.2 pct.</title>
<headline>USAir December load factor rises to 68.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USAir Group Inc Tuesday repoted a 4.6 point increase to 68.2 percent in its December load factor, saying scheduled traffic last month was up 16.5 percent from December 1995.</p>
<p>					     1996		  1995</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  68.2		63.6</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	   3,386.5	   2,923.6</p>
<p> Available seat miles		4,964.4	   4,589.9</p>
<p>				   Fourth Quarter</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  68.1		65.8</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	  10,033.5	   9,054.3</p>
<p> Available seat miles	     14,716.5	  13,723.0</p>
<p>				    year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  68.5		64.7</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	  39,219.8	  38,078.6</p>
<p> Available seat miles	     57,207.9	  58,678.5</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in millions)</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
